      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This sounds like a cool Idea. I know the idea is for things like animal Ears, and I've got an Avatar that could make use of such a feature. But I think Elf ears could also receive some benefit from this. \n\nI wonder how you would make the limit around the head, given it is technically possible to make an avatar without a head bone. My guess would be its simply based off of a radius around where the viewpoint is set. Also I'd think it'd be reasonable to Force symmetry. As interesting as it might be to have asymmetrical ears, that sounds (ha) quite disorienting even for the more adventurous. Though I guess it could be toggled off being part of the same feature (That itself could maybe be toggled per avatar). I don't know exactly, I just want adjustable ear placements to be a thing.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
